{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 2, "text": "或利用汉字偏旁部首，按汉字“六书”造字法创造一些新字记录经文的办法，使这些经文", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 286, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "或利用汉字偏旁部首，按汉字“六书”造字法创造一些新字记录经文的办法，使这些经文", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 286, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 3, "text": "形成了成文经典。", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 354, "w": 310, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "形成了成文经典。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 354, "w": 310, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 4, "text": "其三，已形成比较固定和规范的宗教礼仪。例如，超度亡灵的“殡亡”（byange faangz）", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 414, "w": 1463, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "其三，已形成比较固定和规范的宗教礼仪。例如，超度亡灵的“殡亡”（byange faangz）", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 414, "w": 1463, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 5, "text": "仪式活动，就需经过“请师”、“祭棺”、“开丧”、“转场”（或“砍牛”）、“送仙”、“嘱咐”等几", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 479, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "仪式活动，就需经过“请师”、“祭棺”、“开丧”、“转场”（或“砍牛”）、“送仙”、“嘱咐”等几", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 479, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 6, "text": "个程序。每一个大的程序又往往包含着若干小程序。如“转场”（砍牛）仪式就包含“叫", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 543, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "个程序。每一个大的程序又往往包含着若干小程序。如“转场”（砍牛）仪式就包含“叫", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 543, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 7, "text": "场”、“转场”和“砍牛”三个小的程序。祈福、驱邪、禳灾等比较小型的仪式，也是规范化", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 608, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "场”、“转场”和“砍牛”三个小的程序。祈福、驱邪、禳灾等比较小型的仪式，也是规范化", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 608, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 8, "text": "的。布摩相信，必须遵循代代沿袭下来的仪式程序、规范和禁忌，否则就达不到仪式所欲", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 672, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的。布摩相信，必须遵循代代沿袭下来的仪式程序、规范和禁忌，否则就达不到仪式所欲", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 672, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 9, "text": "达到的目的。", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 741, "w": 231, "h": 55}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "达到的目的。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 741, "w": 231, "h": 55}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 10, "text": "此外，摩教还初步形成了自己的基本教义。摩经认为布依族很多文化事象是报陆陀", "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 801, "w": 1467, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "此外，摩教还初步形成了自己的基本教义。摩经认为布依族很多文化事象是报陆陀", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 801, "w": 1467, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 11, "text": "创设的。人之所以生病，是因为受某种鬼魅作祟，不同的病分别由不同的鬼魅作祟所致，", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 865, "w": 1552, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "创设的。人之所以生病，是因为受某种鬼魅作祟，不同的病分别由不同的鬼魅作祟所致，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 865, "w": 1552, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 12, "text": "需举行相应的仪式予以驱逐，病才会痊愈。人死后，通过“殡亡”仪式，亡灵即可升入“拜”", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 922, "w": 1552, "h": 71}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "需举行相应的仪式予以驱逐，病才会痊愈。人死后，通过“殡亡”仪式，亡灵即可升入“拜”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 922, "w": 1552, "h": 71}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 13, "text": "（bab）和“仙”（sianl）的境界。在阳世与冥世的交界处，有一“桥龙”（铜桥），在生时善良", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 998, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（bab）和“仙”（sianl）的境界。在阳世与冥世的交界处，有一“桥龙”（铜桥），在生时善良", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 998, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 14, "text": "者其灵魂踏上桥时越走越宽，而作偷窃等恶行的人其灵魂踏上去则桥面窄如刀口，不能", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1066, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "者其灵魂踏上桥时越走越宽，而作偷窃等恶行的人其灵魂踏上去则桥面窄如刀口，不能", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1066, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 15, "text": "进去，只能在桥的此岸做野鬼。凶死者的鬼魂被认为堕入了“游魂世界”，要举行“入交”", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1127, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "进去，只能在桥的此岸做野鬼。凶死者的鬼魂被认为堕入了“游魂世界”，要举行“入交”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1127, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 16, "text": "（Ruhjauc），意“赎头”或“招魂”仪式，将其灵魂赎（招）回“生魂世界”，升入仙界。仙界", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1191, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（Ruhjauc），意“赎头”或“招魂”仪式，将其灵魂赎（招）回“生魂世界”，升入仙界。仙界", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1191, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 17, "text": "里有最高神“王代”以及“王绍”、“安王”等众多神灵和许多“拜”（bad）、“仙”（sianl）。亡", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1255, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "里有最高神“王代”以及“王绍”、“安王”等众多神灵和许多“拜”（bad）、“仙”（sianl）。亡", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1255, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 18, "text": "灵在仙界可以娶仙女为妻，可以当管理者，也要耕田种地。但在那里可以长生不老，而且", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1324, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "灵在仙界可以娶仙女为妻，可以当管理者，也要耕田种地。但在那里可以长生不老，而且", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1324, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 19, "text": "成天和“拜”（bab）、“仙”（sianl）相处，荣耀无比，其乐无穷。", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1388, "w": 1025, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "成天和“拜”（bab）、“仙”（sianl）相处，荣耀无比，其乐无穷。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1388, "w": 1025, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 20, "text": "可以看出，摩教已具备了一神教的雏形，同时，原始的多神教也还十分明显，主要表", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1452, "w": 1459, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "可以看出，摩教已具备了一神教的雏形，同时，原始的多神教也还十分明显，主要表", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1452, "w": 1459, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 21, "text": "现在报陆陀虽有被尊为至上神的趋向，但众多的自然神仍处于游离和分散状态，未被真", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1517, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "现在报陆陀虽有被尊为至上神的趋向，但众多的自然神仍处于游离和分散状态，未被真", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1517, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 22, "text": "正纳入一个严密的神灵体系中。", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1581, "w": 551, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "正纳入一个严密的神灵体系中。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1581, "w": 551, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 23, "text": "摩教随布依族国家的灭亡停止了向一神教发展的步伐，各地布摩在互不统属的情况", "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 1646, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "摩教随布依族国家的灭亡停止了向一神教发展的步伐，各地布摩在互不统属的情况", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 1646, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 24, "text": "下千百年来自行履行对摩教的传承，汉字传入布依族地区并为布摩掌握，在借用来记录", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1710, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "下千百年来自行履行对摩教的传承，汉字传入布依族地区并为布摩掌握，在借用来记录", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1710, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 25, "text": "经典之前，摩教一直是靠口耳传承。汉文化传入后佛教和道教对各地摩教也产生程度不", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1774, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "经典之前，摩教一直是靠口耳传承。汉文化传入后佛教和道教对各地摩教也产生程度不", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1774, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 26, "text": "同的影响。因此，今天各地布摩的经典及宗教礼仪虽有很多共同因素，但也形成了相当", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1835, "w": 1552, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "同的影响。因此，今天各地布摩的经典及宗教礼仪虽有很多共同因素，但也形成了相当", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1835, "w": 1552, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 27, "text": "多的差异。", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1905, "w": 190, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "多的差异。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1905, "w": 190, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 28, "text": "二、摩教的性质、内容和特点", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1971, "w": 486, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "二、摩教的性质、内容和特点", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1971, "w": 486, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 29, "text": "（一）摩教性质", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 2035, "w": 262, "h": 47}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（一）摩教性质", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 2035, "w": 262, "h": 47}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 30, "text": "布依族摩教以鬼神观念和冥世观念作为信仰的思想基础，以祖先崇拜为信仰的核", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 2096, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族摩教以鬼神观念和冥世观念作为信仰的思想基础，以祖先崇拜为信仰的核", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 2096, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 130, "line_no": 31, "text": "心，以解脱疾病痛苦和导引亡灵进入极乐世界为信仰宗旨。它是在自然宗教基础上，利", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 2160, "w": 1552, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "心，以解脱疾病痛苦和导引亡灵进入极乐世界为信仰宗旨。它是在自然宗教基础上，利", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 2160, "w": 1552, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
